<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Grow A Garden 2 - Loja Oficial</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#0d1117;
    color:white;
}

header{
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#16a34a,#22c55e);
    text-align:center;
    padding:40px 20px;
}

header h1{
    font-size:3rem;
}

header p{
    margin-top:10px;
    font-size:1.2rem;
}

.container{
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:30px 15px;
}

.produtos{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
}

.card{
    background:#161b22;
    border:2px solid #22c55e;
    border-radius:15px;
    padding:20px;
    text-align:center;
    transition:0.3s;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(34,197,94,.6);
}

.card h2{
    color:#22c55e;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.preco{
    font-size:2rem;
    font-weight:bold;
    color:#ffd700;
    margin:15px 0;
}

.btn{
    display:inline-block;
    background:#25D366;
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:12px 25px;
    border-radius:10px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

.btn:hover{
    opacity:.9;
}

.info{
    margin-top:40px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
}

.box{
    background:#161b22;
    border-radius:15px;
    padding:20px;
    text-align:center;
}

footer{
    background:#161b22;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
    margin-top:40px;
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>🌱 Grow A Garden 2</h1>
    <p>Ofertas Imperdíveis • Entrega Rápida e Segura</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

    <div class="produtos">

        <div class="card">
            <h2>⭐ Star Fruit</h2>
            <div class="preco">R$ 4,00</div>
            <a href="https://wa.me/5517996377365?text=Olá,%20quero%20comprar%20Star%20Fruit" class="btn">Comprar</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>🌙 Moon Blox</h2>
            <div class="preco">R$ 1,00</div>
            <a href="https://wa.me/5517996377365?text=Olá,%20quero%20comprar%20Moon%20Blox" class="btn">Comprar</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>🔥 Dragon Breath</h2>
            <div class="preco">R$ 1,00</div>
            <a href="https://wa.me/5517996377365?text=Olá,%20quero%20comprar%20Dragon%20Breath" class="btn">Comprar</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>👻 Ghost Pepper</h2>
            <div class="preco">R$ 1,00</div>
            <a href="https://wa.me/5517996377365?text=Olá,%20quero%20comprar%20Ghost%20Pepper" class="btn">Comprar</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>🎋 1000 Bamboo</h2>
            <div class="preco">R$ 1,00</div>
            <a href="https://wa.me/5517996377365?text=Olá,%20quero%20comprar%201000%20Bamboo" class="btn">Comprar</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>🌻 Sun Blom</h2>
            <div class="preco">R$ 2,00</div>
            <a href="https://wa.me/5517996377365?text=Olá,%20quero%20comprar%20Sun%20Blom" class="btn">Comprar</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>🌀 Hipno Blom</h2>
            <div class="preco">R$ 1,00</div>
            <a href="https://wa.me/5517996377365?text=Olá,%20quero%20comprar%20Hipno%20Blom" class="btn">Comprar</a>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="info">

        <div class="box">
            <h3>🛡️ 100% Seguro</h3>
            <p>Transações protegidas.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="box">
            <h3>⚡ Entrega na Hora</h3>
            <p>Entrega rápida após confirmação.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="box">
            <h3>💎 Melhores Preços</h3>
            <p>Ofertas exclusivas e atualizadas.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="box">
            <h3>🎁 Qualidade Garantida</h3>
            <p>Atendimento direto pelo WhatsApp.</p>
        </div>

    </div>

</div>

<footer>
    🚀 Corre que é por tempo limitado!
</footer>

</body>
</html>